    {
      "title": "The Core Insight",
      "content": "Imagine a quantum particle moving on a lattice, with its position changing over time. The <strong>quantum dynamical bounds</strong> describe how fast the particle can move. We use an analogy with a <code>random walk</code> to understand the bounds.",
