      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "We employ <strong>Weyl's method</strong> and <strong>Vinogradov's method</strong> to analyze the <code>skew-shift dynamics</code> on semi-algebraic sets. This helps us improve the quantum dynamical upper bounds.",
